-has-actions\" style=\"\">Ingredients<div class=\"wprm-decoration-spacer\"></div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-internal-container wprm-internal-container-ingredients wprm-expandable-container wprm-expandable-expanded\" style=\"\"><div class=\"wprm-internal-container-toggle\"><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-show\" aria-label=\"Show Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,9.5 8,5 12.5,9.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-hide\" aria-label=\"Hide Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,6.5 8,11 12.5,6.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-group\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-ingredient-group-name wprm-block-text-bold\" style=\"color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">Ingredients</div><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 5px;\"></div><ul class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredients\"><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cup</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">Nutella</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">Rich chocolate hazelnut spread for fudginess</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">2</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">large</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">eggs</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">Binds the ingredients together</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1/2</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cup</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">all-purpose flour</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">Adds structure and texture</span></li></ul></div></div></div>\n      <div id=\"recipe-10949-equipment\" class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-container wprm-block-text-normal\" data-recipe=\"10949\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-equipment-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none\" style=\"\">Equipment</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-internal-container wprm-internal-container-equipment wprm-expandable-container wprm-expandable-expanded\" style=\"\"><div class=\"wprm-internal-container-toggle\"><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-show\" aria-label=\"Show Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,9.5 8,5 12.5,9.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-hide\" aria-label=\"Hide Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,6.5 8,11 12.5,6.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a></div><ul class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment wprm-recipe-equipment-list\"><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 8×8-inch baking pan&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">Greased for easy removal</span></div></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Mixing bowl&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For combining ingredients</span></div></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Whisk or spoon&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For mixing the batter</span></div></li></ul></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-50 meadow-main-right\">\n      <div id=\"recipe-10949-instructions\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-10949-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal\" data-recipe=\"10949\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-spacer wprm-header-has-actions\" style=\"\">Method<div class=\"wprm-decoration-spacer\"></div>&nbsp;</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-group\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-instruction-group-name wprm-block-text-bold\" style=\"color: #000000;\">Instructions</div><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 5px;\"></div><ol class=\"wprm-recipe-instructions\"><li id=\"wprm-recipe-10949-step-0-0\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 1: Preheat the Oven &#8211; First things first, preheat your oven to 350°F (175°C). This ensures your brownies bake evenly and come out perfectly fudgy.</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-10949-step-0-1\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 2: Mix the Ingredients &#8211; In a mixing bowl, stir together 1 cup of Nutella, 2 large eggs, and 1/2 cup of all-purpose flour. Mix until the batter is smooth and well combined. Don’t be afraid to get a little messy; it’s all part of the fun!</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-10949-step-0-2\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 3: Bake the Brownies &#8211; Pour the batter into a greased 8×8-inch baking pan and spread it evenly. Bake in the preheated oven for 20–25 minutes. Keep an eye on them, and do the toothpick test: it should come out with moist crumbs when they’re ready.</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-10949-step-0-3\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 4: Cool and Cut &#8211; Once baked, let the brownies cool in the pan for a bit. Then, cut them into squares and enjoy your delicious 3 ingredient brownies!</span></div></li></ol></div></div>\n      \n      \n      <div id=\"recipe-10949-notes\" class=\"wprm-recipe-notes-container wprm-block-text-normal\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-notes-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none\" style=\"\">Notes</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-notes\"><table>\n<tr>\n<th>Nutrient</th>\n<th>Amount per Serving</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Calories</td>\n<td>150</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fat</td>\n<td>8g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Protein</td>\n<td>3g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carbs</td>\n<td>18g</td>\n</tr>\n</table></div></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 40px;\"></div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"ingredients\"><strong>Ingredients</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Get ready to whip up some delicious 3 ingredient <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate_brownie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">brownies </a>with these simple ingredients!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Ingredients-for-Easy-3-Ingredient-Brownies.webp\" alt=\"Ingredients for 3 ingredient brownies displayed on a kitchen table, including Nutella, eggs, and flour.\" class=\"wp-image-10947\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Ingredients-for-Easy-3-Ingredient-Brownies.webp 400w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Ingredients-for-Easy-3-Ingredient-Brownies-225x300.webp 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>1 cup Nutella</strong> – rich chocolate hazelnut spread for fudginess</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>2 large eggs</strong> – binds the ingredients together</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1/2 cup all-purpose flour</strong> – adds structure and texture</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-to-make-3-ingredient-brownies\"><strong>How to Make 3 ingredient brownies</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Get ready to whip up some delicious 3 ingredient brownies! With just a few simple steps, you’ll have rich and fudgy brownies in no time. The preparation time is only 10 minutes, and the cooking time is 20–25 minutes. Allow a little extra time for cooling before you dive in!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Step-by-Step-Guide-to-3-Ingredient-Brownies.webp\" alt=\"Four-step process of making 3 ingredient brownies, showcasing preheating the oven, mixing ingredients, pouring batter into a pan, and cooling baked brownies.\" class=\"wp-image-10948\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Step-by-Step-Guide-to-3-Ingredient-Brownies.webp 400w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Step-by-Step-Guide-to-3-Ingredient-Brownies-225x300.webp 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 1: Preheat the Oven</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">First things first, preheat your oven to 350°F (175°C). This ensures your brownies bake evenly and come out perfectly fudgy.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 2: Mix the Ingredients</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a mixing bowl, stir together 1 cup of Nutella, 2 large eggs, and 1/2 cup of all-purpose flour. Mix until the batter is smooth and well combined. Don’t be afraid to get a little messy; it’s all part of the fun!</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 3: Bake the Brownies</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pour the batter into a greased 8×8-inch baking pan and spread it evenly. Bake in the preheated oven for 20–25 minutes. Keep an eye on them, and do the toothpick test: it should come out with moist crumbs when they’re ready.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 4: Cool and Cut</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Once baked, let the brownies cool in the pan for a bit. Then, cut them into squares and enjoy your delicious 3 ingredient brownies!</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"recipe-snapshot\"><strong>Recipe Snapshot</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Category</td><td>Dessert</td></tr><tr><td>Cuisine</td><td>American</td></tr><tr><td>Prep Time</td><td>10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Cook Time</td><td>25 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Extra Time</td><td>0 minutes (Cooling)</td></tr><tr><td>Total Time</td><td>35 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Dietary</td><td>Vegetarian</td></tr><tr><td>Serves</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Best Served</td><td>Warm and fudgy!</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"pro-tips-for-making-3-ingredient-brownies\"><strong>Pro Tips for Making 3 ingredient brownies</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Opt for creamy peanut butter for a rich flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use a silicone baking pan for easy removal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Mix until just combined to keep them fudgy.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Let them cool completely before cutting for cleaner edges.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Add a sprinkle of sea salt on top for a delightful contrast.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-to-serve-this-3-ingredient-brownies\"><strong>How to Serve this 3 ingredient brownies</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Top with a scoop of vanilla ice cream for a delightful contrast.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Drizzle with chocolate or caramel sauce for extra indulgence.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Serve warm with fresh berries for a fruity twist.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pair with a dollop of whipped coconut cream for a dairy-free option.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enjoy with a cup of coffee or tea for a cozy treat.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"make-ahead-and-storage\"><strong>Make Ahead and Storage</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can make these delicious brownies ahead of time and store them for later enjoyment:</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Storing 3 Ingredient Brownies Leftovers</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Allow brownies to cool completely before storing.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Place in an airtight container at room temperature.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>For longer freshness, refrigerate for up to a week.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Freezing 3 Ingredient Brownies</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Wrap brownies tightly in plastic wrap or foil.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Place wrapped brownies in a freezer-safe bag or container.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Freeze for up to three months for best quality.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Reheating 3 Ingredient Brownies</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Thaw brownies in the refrigerator overnight if frozen.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reheat in the microwave for 10-15 seconds for a warm treat.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>For a crispy edge, warm in the oven at 350°F (175°C) for 5-10 minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Explore more easy <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/breakfast/\"><strong>breakfast</strong></a> recipes, quick <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/lunch/\"><strong>lunch</strong></a> ideas, cozy <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/dinner/\"><strong>dinner</strong></a> meals, tasty <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/snacks/\"><strong>snacks</strong></a>, and delightful <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/dessert/\"><strong>dessert</strong></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"fa-qs\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here’s a helpful FAQ about this recipe:</p>\n\n\n<div id=\"rank-math-faq\" class=\"rank-math-block\">\n<div class=\"rank-math-list \">\n<div id=\"faq-question-1\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>1. How to make brownies with 3 ingredients?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>Making brownies with just three ingredients is incredibly simple! You’ll need chocolate, eggs, and a sweetener like sugar or a sugar substitute. Melt the chocolate, mix in the eggs and sweetener until smooth, pour into a baking dish, and bake until set. It’s that easy!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-2\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>2. How to make a 2 ingredient brownie?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>To make a 2-ingredient brownie, you can combine just chocolate and eggs. Melt the chocolate, mix in the eggs until well combined, and bake. This will yield a fudgy brownie, though it may be a bit denser than the 3-ingredient version!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-3\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>3. What are the 3-ingredient brownies without flour?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>3-ingredient brownies without flour typically use chocolate, eggs, and a sweetener. This recipe is naturally gluten-free and still delivers a rich, fudgy texture without the need for any flour. Perfect for those avoiding gluten!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-4\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>4. What can I bake with three ingredients?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>With just three ingredients, you can bake a variety of treats! Besides brownies, consider making simple cookies, pancakes, or even a quick mug cake. The possibilities are endless, and it’s a fun way to experiment in the kitchen!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"final-thoughts\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These 3 ingredient brownies are not just a treat; they’re a delightful trip down memory lane! With just a few simple ingredients, you can whip up a batch of rich, fudgy goodness that will have everyone smiling. So grab your mixing bowl and enjoy the sweet satisfaction of baking something delicious in no time!</p>\n",
